    {
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentPreview": "TEST COVERAGE GAPS, all judged safe to ship: (1) PathRouterTests.TryToFileEntityPath_RejectsUnsafeNames has no rooted-path case (e.g. \u0027C:\\foo\u0027) even though FileEntityName.IsValid checks Path.IsPathRooted. (2) StorePurityInvariantTests.MemoriesDirectory_NeverContainsFileEntities globs only *.md under memories/, while its own class doc states the invariant as \u0027no .md AND no foreign .meta.json\u0027 \u2014 adding the second glob needs a known-names filter, so it is a real judgement call not an oversight. (3)",
