      "chunkIndex": 5,
      "contentPreview": "DELIBERATE BEHAVIOUR CHANGE now documented in code, do not \u0027fix\u0027 it back: BundleFormatService\u0027s per-file import containment was re-anchored from the .scrinia base to categoryDir. That is STRONGER against traversal but WEAKER for symlinks \u2014 a symlinked .scrinia/agent pointing outside .scrinia was denied before and is permitted now. It is consistent with the write path (TryToFileEntityPath), which never had the outer check. A comment at the check records this.",
