    {
      "chunkIndex": 6,
      "contentPreview": "WHY FileEntityDirectories_SitOutsideTheStore looks weak but is not: the final reviewer established that because PathRouter.ToStoreDir unconditionally prefixes .scrinia/memories and PathParser/SanitizeName both reject \u0027..\u0027, EVERY store scope directory is within memories/. So !IsWithin(memories, fileEntityDir) is logically sufficient to exclude all of them at once. The test is narrow but complete \u2014 leave it alone.",
